{"id":"05d7b908303b22f7","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases.md","title":"Definition II.1 Sheaves on an Intersection Stable Basis","display":"Definition II.1 Sheaves on an Intersection Stable Basis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases","aliases":["14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases"],"display":"Definition II.1 Sheaves on an Intersection Stable Basis","depends_on":["[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]"],"source_location":"II.1 Theorem 3, printed 69; II Exercise 4, printed 104; DjVu 40,58","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition II.1 Sheaves on an Intersection Stable Basis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.1 Theorem 3, printed 69; II Exercise 4, printed 104; DjVu 40,58"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(P_0,P_1):\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(P=(P_0,P_1):\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(B)=P_0(B)\">\\(P(B)=P_0(B)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\in\\mathcal B\">\\(B,C\\in\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq B\">\\(C\\subseteq B\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s|_C\">\\(s|_C\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^B_{P,C}(s)\">\\(\\rho^B_{P,C}(s)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in P(B)\">\\(s\\in P(B)\\)</span>）；底层限制函数在下式以 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_3\">\\(\\pi_3\\)</span> 定义，不能独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_1\">\\(P_1\\)</span> 另行选取。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Basis}\">\\(\\mathrm{Basis}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeetBasis}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeetBasis}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho^B_{P,C}\\coloneqq\\pi_3(P_1(B,C))\\qquad(B,C\\in\\mathcal B,\\ C\\subseteq B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho^B_{P,C}\\coloneqq\\pi_3(P_1(B,C))\\qquad(B,C\\in\\mathcal B,\\ C\\subseteq B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Basis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Basis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Basis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\land\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\cap C\\in\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Basis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\land\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\cap C\\in\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}(P,\\mathcal B)\\iff\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(P,\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau),\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\;\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A=B\\Rightarrow\\forall(s_A)\\in\\prod_{A\\in\\mathcal A}P(A)\\;\\left((\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal A\\;s_A|_{A\\cap C}=s_C|_{A\\cap C})\\Rightarrow\\exists!s\\in P(B)\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(s|_A=s_A)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}(P,\\mathcal B)\\iff\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(P,\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau),\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\;\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A=B\\Rightarrow\\forall(s_A)\\in\\prod_{A\\in\\mathcal A}P(A)\\;\\left((\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal A\\;s_A|_{A\\cap C}=s_C|_{A\\cap C})\\Rightarrow\\exists!s\\in P(B)\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(s|_A=s_A)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau):=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}(\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau),\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau):=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}(\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau),\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>加入空集只是便于让所有交都留在基内，不损失通常的基；可以先向原基加入空集。这里覆盖只允许基开集，后续延拓定理说明这些数据已经足以恢复全部开集上的层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$；$\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau$。$P=(P_0,P_1):\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为函子，$P(B)=P_0(B)$。$B,C\\in\\mathcal B$、$C\\subseteq B$ 时，$s|_C$ 缩写 $\\rho^B_{P,C}(s)$（$s\\in P(B)$）；底层限制函数在下式以 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 的 $\\pi_3$ 定义，不能独立于 $P_1$ 另行选取。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"P=(P_0,P_1):\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"P(B)=P_0(B)","display":false},{"tex":"B,C\\in\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq B","display":false},{"tex":"s|_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho^B_{P,C}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in P(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_3","display":false},{"tex":"P_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Basis}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeetBasis}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho^B_{P,C}\\coloneqq\\pi_3(P_1(B,C))\\qquad(B,C\\in\\mathcal B,\\ C\\subseteq B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Basis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Basis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\land\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\cap C\\in\\mathcal B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}(P,\\mathcal B)\\iff\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(P,\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau),\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\;\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A=B\\Rightarrow\\forall(s_A)\\in\\prod_{A\\in\\mathcal A}P(A)\\;\\left((\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal A\\;s_A|_{A\\cap C}=s_C|_{A\\cap C})\\Rightarrow\\exists!s\\in P(B)\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(s|_A=s_A)\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau):=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}(\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau),\\mathcal B).","display":true}],"bytes":2597,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases|Definition II.1 Sheaves on an Intersection Stable Basis]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases|Definition II.1 Sheaves on an Intersection Stable Basis]]"},{"id":"e178b36b56d859a4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$。$\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)$、$\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}(P,\\mathcal B)$，基范畴采用 [[14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases]]；$\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)$ 采用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 的满子范畴。$F,G$ 为 $X$ 上层；$R,T$ 为基范畴上的预层。自然变换均为 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 的带源靶三元组编码；基上的对应自然变换集合在下式直接以函子范畴 Hom 定义。$\\rho$ 表示限制箭头的底层函数。"}],"outgoing":["1601eff2507fda14","f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0"]}